# Native projects are GENERATED, not authored (D25: Expo managed + continuous
# native generation). `app.json` and its config plugins are the source of
# truth; `npx expo prebuild` recreates these from it, so committing them would
# create a second authority that silently drifts from the plugin config —
# exactly how a plugin change stops taking effect.
#
# Created by `expo run:ios` on 2026-09-11, which prebuilds before it builds.
# Delete and re-prebuild freely; nothing here is hand-edited.
